          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "冻结后的 feature 能走通 `change intake -> reopen -> prd revise -> user-story refresh -> test-case refresh -> prototype refresh -> re-freeze -> implement fix -> qa delta-run -> release recheck`。",
